+        """Done-callback on the concurrent future: fires exactly once for
+        normal completion, exception, or cancellation of a still-queued job,
+        so the occupancy count can neither leak up (queued job cancelled
+        before its thread starts) nor down (started thread keeps its slot
+        until it actually finishes — threads cannot be cancelled)."""
+        with LocalSTCrossEncoder._pending_lock:
